FIVE OF SWORDS [Defeat] - Dishonour, Loss of integrity, Dubious victory, Dishonesty, Selfishness, Risk, Hostility, Spite, Danger. conflict, disgrace, dishonor, or treacherous acts.
Number: (disruption, lesson) defeat, redirection
Astrology: Venus in Aquarius. Venus shows what we value. In Aquarius we value the cause we are championing, with little or no empathy or compassion for the individuals whose lives are affected by our actions.
TOL: Gevurah. In this card, we do not need to apply a mid-course correction, as it has been applied for us, by others or by life itself. What we do have control over is how we react to the correction.

