KNIGHT OF CUPS (controlling, directing) - Serene, Gentle, Composed, Wise, Diplomatic, Compassionate, Accepting, Tolerant, Non-Judgemental, A healer, Calm, gentleness, serenity, wisdom, diplomacy, compassion, patience, tolerance and healing=A Wise Successful Man 
Number: (Fire, Water, driving) 
Astrology: Two-thirds Pisces, one-third Aquarius. The King has a full understanding of the non-rational and non-linear patterns of emotional life (Pisces), yet desires to use this understanding to help society in general (Aquarius).
TOL: Chokhmah. The King of Cups uses his will to bring emotional balance and harmony into the world around him.
REVERSED Disrupted, Uncentered, Scattered, Foolish, Tactless, Uncaring, Judgemental, Destructive

