FIVE OF CUPS [Disappointment] - Loss, Regret, Doubt, Setback, Defeat, Bereavement, End of a relationship, Grief, Sorrow, Feelings of discontentment and loss
Number: (disruption, lesson) loss, re-view
Astrology: Mars in Scorpio. Like a bull in a china shop, reality stampedes across your fragile map of reality (Mars), painfully forcing you to re-examine and redraw the map (Scorpio).
TOL: Sphere 5 Correction (Gevurah). When the woman on the card notices that real life differs from how she would prefer it to be, she must apply a corrective to her expectations to avoid further heartache.

