THE HIGH PRIESTESS - Intuition, Higher consciousness, Potential, Mystery, Receptivity, Inner Truth. Psychic/occult knowledge. Soul level, Spiritual, Wisdom.
Astrology: The Moon - the subconscious mind. Dreams, Meditation.
Hebrew: Gimel - Camel. Used to cross the desert; the gulf between the conscious and the subconscious. (Reward)
TOL - Tipheret to Netzach (Instinct). Our inner wholeness makes itself known to us through intuitions, dreams, messages from the subconscious, and other irrational means. We reach toward wholeness through the medium of our intuition.
REVERSED Losing touch with reality, Getting lost in the depths, Disengagement, Blocked intuition, Focusing on the material, Blocked potential, Fear of truth

